    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: '.Get Bonus packages by purchasing our promotions. The more you purchase,
    the better bonus you get.

    .Each package will expite in max 30 days. Bonus
    must be used within one month of receiving it.

    .Maximum cashback of 10%
    of the game calue will be released from your Bonus into your Deposit balance
    after every Cash Game.

    For Example, if you lose a game with an entry fee
    of Rs.100, a bonus of Rs.10 will be added to your account.

    .Account verification:
    Only one JeetoRummy account per person.

    .If multiple accounts are detected,
    the entire bonus amount on all accounts will be cancelled. Terms of Service are
    applicable to all services

    offered on JeetoTummy. Any violation of the terms
    at any stage may result in disqualification and further course of action as per
    the Terms

    of Service.For any queries, you can get in touch with our customer
    support'
